%% ① 新增租户（OCR 录入流程）
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 房东
    participant F as TenantForm
    participant C as useCamera
    participant O as useOCR/idCardOCR
    participant T as tesseract.js
    participant S as tenantStore
    participant R as repository
    participant L as localStore
    participant P as photoDB
    participant K as crypto

    U->>F: 点击"新增租户"
    U->>C: 拍照/上传证件照
    C->>P: saveBlob(imageBlob)
    P-->>C: photoId
    C-->>F: 预览照片 + photoId
    U->>O: 触发 OCR 识别
    O->>T: recognize(imageBlob, lang=chi_sim)
    T-->>O: rawText
    O->>O: parseName + parseIdCard(rawText)
    O-->>F: 回填 name / idCard(明文草稿)
    F-->>U: 展示识别结果, 提示"请核对"
    U->>F: 人工核对/修正 姓名、身份证号、手机号、缴费周期、押金
    F->>K: encrypt(idCard)
    K-->>F: idCardEnc
    F->>F: maskIdCard(idCard) → idCardMasked
    U->>F: 提交
    F->>S: addTenant(payload{idCardEnc,idCardMasked,idCardPhotoId,...})
    S->>R: create("tenant", entity)
    R->>L: setItem("tenants", [...])
    L-->>R: ok
    R-->>S: savedEntity
    S-->>F: 成功
    F-->>U: 跳转租户列表, Toast"保存成功"

%% ② 录入用电量并生成当月账单
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 房东
    participant M as MeterRecordForm
    participant FS as feeStore
    participant BE as billingEngine
    participant BG as billGenerator
    participant BS as billStore
    participant R as repository

    U->>M: 选择房间 + 月份, 录入 上期/本期读数(或直填用量)
    M->>M: computeUsage(prev,curr) 或 直填
    U->>M: 保存
    M->>FS: saveMeterRecord({roomId,month,usage})
    FS->>R: create("meterRecord", rec)
    R-->>FS: ok
    U->>BS: 点击"生成/刷新 当月账单"
    BS->>R: getTenantByRoom(roomId)
    BS->>R: getFeeTypes()
    BS->>R: getMeterRecords(roomId,month)
    BS->>R: getHeatingFees(tenantId,month)
    BS->>R: getPayments(tenantId,month)
    BS->>BE: computeMonthlyBill(ctx)
    BE->>BE: 租金(按周期/预存抵扣) + 电费(用量×单价) + 供暖费 + 自定义费用
    BE-->>BG: BillItem[]
    BG->>BG: 聚合 totalReceivable, 比对 totalPaid → outstanding
    BG->>BS: upsertBill(bill)
    BS->>R: create/update("bill", bill)
    R-->>BS: ok
    BS-->>U: 展示账单: 应收/已缴/欠费

%% ③ 导出/导入备份
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 房东
    participant SP as SettingsPage
    participant BK as backup
    participant R as repository
    participant P as photoDB
    participant L as localStore

    U->>SP: 点击"导出备份"
    SP->>BK: exportAll()
    BK->>R: getAllEntities()
    BK->>P: getAllBlobs()
    P-->>BK: Photo[]{id,blob}
    BK->>BK: blob→base64, 组装 {version,exportedAt,data,photos}
    BK-->>SP: JSON string
    SP->>SP: 浏览器下载 landlord-backup-YYYYMMDD.json
    SP-->>U: Toast"导出成功"

    Note over U,SP: 导入流程
    U->>SP: 选择备份文件
    SP->>BK: importAll(fileJSON)
    BK->>BK: 校验 version/schema
    BK->>L: 覆盖写入各实体
    BK->>P: base64→blob, 批量写回
    BK-->>SP: 成功
    SP-->>U: 刷新页面, Toast"恢复成功"
